WEBVTT

00:00:24.460 --> 00:00:26.790
Hang in there, Grea!

00:00:26.790 --> 00:00:29.630
Clearly all of these readings are abnormal.

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:32.840
But there's nothing that tells us
why this is happening...

00:00:33.210 --> 00:00:35.960
Are there no other methods
we can use to diagnose her?

00:00:35.960 --> 00:00:39.430
I've never seen any records that explain
how to treat a Dragonborn.

00:00:43.880 --> 00:00:44.810
Hanna!

00:00:44.810 --> 00:00:46.420
Please hold her tail down!

00:00:46.420 --> 00:00:47.150
Yes, ma'am!

00:00:51.000 --> 00:00:52.340
Princess?

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:04.910
Mysteria Friends

00:01:00.290 --> 00:01:01.390
Grea...?

00:01:05.540 --> 00:01:11.180
Agony of Grea

00:01:16.790 --> 00:01:21.430
We tried various forms of healing magic,
but they had no effect on her at all.

00:01:22.420 --> 00:01:26.510
Medicinal plants and compound medicines
had no effect either.

00:01:31.540 --> 00:01:33.470
Can you hear me, Grea?

00:01:33.830 --> 00:01:34.840
Grea...

00:01:36.250 --> 00:01:40.720
We checked every part of her body,
but didn't find any external injuries.

00:01:41.080 --> 00:01:43.300
I wonder if this is something 
unique to Dragonborns...

00:01:45.580 --> 00:01:48.340
Heave-ho! Heave-ho!

00:01:48.920 --> 00:01:50.060
Lou?

00:01:50.060 --> 00:01:51.790
Heave-ho... ah!

00:01:53.130 --> 00:01:55.640
Again? You're always so clumsy.

00:01:56.290 --> 00:01:57.800
Be more careful from now on.

00:01:58.920 --> 00:01:59.800
This is...

00:01:59.800 --> 00:02:01.130
Owie...

00:02:01.130 --> 00:02:04.060
I brought some books that might be helpful.

00:02:04.580 --> 00:02:07.050
This is a book about medicine for Goblins.

00:02:07.460 --> 00:02:11.140
And this one is on the ecology of insects.

00:02:12.750 --> 00:02:16.590
Lou? Where did you get this book from?

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:21.420
This is one of the books that's
supposed to be prohibited to students!

00:02:21.420 --> 00:02:22.170
Well, I went to the library and explained that
there was an emergency with Grea's health.

00:02:22.170 --> 00:02:23.330
"Prohibited"?
Well, I went to the library and explained that
there was an emergency with Grea's health.

00:02:23.330 --> 00:02:25.750
Well, I went to the library and explained that
there was an emergency with Grea's health.

00:02:25.750 --> 00:02:28.580
So, the person at the desk 
lent me all these books.

00:02:28.580 --> 00:02:31.960
Who in the world was at the desk today?

00:02:31.960 --> 00:02:34.430
The real question is where 
this book came from.

00:02:35.670 --> 00:02:36.840
Princess?

00:02:36.840 --> 00:02:38.880
Keep an eye on Grea for me!

00:02:38.880 --> 00:02:39.840
Anne?

00:02:39.840 --> 00:02:40.710
What's the matter, Anne?

00:02:40.710 --> 00:02:41.760
Princess?!
What's the matter, Anne?

00:04:02.790 --> 00:04:05.590
Where did Anne run off to?

00:04:06.000 --> 00:04:09.540
I suspect she went to the
forbidden archives of the library.

00:04:09.540 --> 00:04:10.600
"Forbidden"?

00:04:52.430 --> 00:04:55.310
Grea has a really high fever!

00:04:55.310 --> 00:04:58.260
Let me check. As the teacher, 
I should handle this.

00:04:59.580 --> 00:05:02.290
Hanna, start preparing
some medicine to lower her fever.

00:05:02.290 --> 00:05:03.570
Understood.

00:05:09.580 --> 00:05:10.580
Princess?

00:05:10.580 --> 00:05:13.010
I'm okay, don't worry.

00:06:23.420 --> 00:06:24.480
What's happening?

00:06:31.710 --> 00:06:34.050
This is... the library?!

00:06:34.420 --> 00:06:38.050
Looks like we found a shortcut
without even realizing it, Princess.

00:06:39.380 --> 00:06:40.670
I need you to get everything on this list!

00:06:40.670 --> 00:06:41.510
Right!

00:06:47.970 --> 00:06:49.220
Not any of these.

00:06:52.380 --> 00:06:54.010
What was written on that tablet?

00:06:54.460 --> 00:06:58.300
There were some parts I wasn't able
to decipher, but all that's left is...

00:06:59.960 --> 00:07:02.470
Where are we going to get a dragon scale?!

00:07:12.670 --> 00:07:13.780
Grea?

00:07:13.780 --> 00:07:16.170
Whoa! Grea, you're okay!
Are you awake now, Grea?

00:07:16.170 --> 00:07:17.960
Grea? Hey, Grea? Grea!
Are you all right?

00:07:17.960 --> 00:07:19.460
Grea? Hey, Grea? Grea!
Grea, can you hear us? Can you speak?

00:07:19.460 --> 00:07:19.790
Grea, can you hear us? Can you speak?

00:07:20.500 --> 00:07:21.620
Grea!

00:07:31.670 --> 00:07:33.890
Gr... Grea?

00:08:12.880 --> 00:08:13.970
Grea?

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:31.830
Huh?

00:08:31.830 --> 00:08:33.050
Anne?

00:08:33.050 --> 00:08:34.860
Um...

00:08:36.460 --> 00:08:37.720
Good morning.

00:08:39.040 --> 00:08:40.000
Good morning...

00:08:40.000 --> 00:08:41.290
Hey, Anne?

00:08:41.290 --> 00:08:41.630
Good morning, Grea!

00:08:41.630 --> 00:08:42.670
What is it?
Good morning, Grea!

00:08:42.670 --> 00:08:43.170
Good morning, Grea!

00:08:43.170 --> 00:08:44.080
Good morning!

00:08:44.080 --> 00:08:46.040
Wh-what's wrong, Anne?

00:08:47.130 --> 00:08:47.630
You dummy! Big dummy! I was so worried!
Actually, where are we?

00:08:47.630 --> 00:08:49.670
I'm so relieved!
You dummy! Big dummy! I was so worried!
Actually, where are we?

00:08:49.670 --> 00:08:51.300
You dummy! Big dummy! I was so worried!

00:08:52.710 --> 00:08:54.050
Anne?

00:08:54.500 --> 00:08:55.670
Can I put on some clothes?

00:08:55.670 --> 00:08:56.510
Grea!

00:09:13.330 --> 00:09:14.590
Molting?

00:09:15.040 --> 00:09:16.220
Well...

00:09:16.630 --> 00:09:18.920
It happens sometimes as I grow up.

00:09:18.920 --> 00:09:20.830
Your hair also grew out!

00:09:33.210 --> 00:09:36.750
Huh? Is it just me or did 
your chest get larger, too?

00:09:36.750 --> 00:09:39.550
That's also a possibility...

00:09:42.330 --> 00:09:45.350
I guess I just needed to leave you be.

00:09:45.670 --> 00:09:47.920
Well, I'm sorry.

00:09:47.920 --> 00:09:49.860
You went through a lot for me.

00:09:49.860 --> 00:09:51.550
It's fine, don't worry.

00:09:51.880 --> 00:09:54.720
In the end, I wasn't able 
to do anything to help you.

00:09:56.880 --> 00:10:01.620
If I had known, I would have stayed by your side
while you were struggling.

00:10:01.620 --> 00:10:02.710
Huh?

00:10:02.710 --> 00:10:05.120
Was it really... that bad?

00:10:06.830 --> 00:10:07.890
Yeah!

00:10:08.120 --> 00:10:10.380
It was quite the sight to see!

00:10:16.330 --> 00:10:19.040
Anne? What are you holding there?

00:10:19.040 --> 00:10:21.510
N-nothing, really!

00:10:25.420 --> 00:10:27.510
Is that my...?

00:10:34.900 --> 00:10:37.380
Uh... well, this is just...

00:10:37.380 --> 00:10:41.080
I thought maybe I would keep it
as proof of how much we've grown!

00:10:41.080 --> 00:10:42.760
Or something like that...

00:10:48.380 --> 00:10:49.930
Anne, you dummy.

00:11:36.000 --> 00:11:41.010
Episode 3
Princess's Holiday

00:11:36.460 --> 00:11:41.010
Mysteria Friends, episode 
3: "Princess's Holiday."

00:11:41.010 --> 00:11:46.010
Illustration by Nijihara

00:11:54.210 --> 00:11:55.500
I knew it!

00:11:55.500 --> 00:11:57.140
It got fatter...

00:12:04.500 --> 00:12:06.050
What am I going to do?

00:12:33.420 --> 00:12:34.880
Grea, give me a shake.

00:12:34.880 --> 00:12:36.040
Of my tail?!

00:12:36.040 --> 00:12:38.430
No, of salt.

00:12:39.750 --> 00:12:41.130
Oh, sorry.

00:12:41.130 --> 00:12:42.470
Thank you.

00:12:44.960 --> 00:12:47.910
You're not eating very much today, Grea.

00:12:47.910 --> 00:12:50.180
You think so?

00:12:51.880 --> 00:12:54.210
Yeah, you should really eat more bec-

00:12:54.210 --> 00:12:57.390
I mean, you just finished molting.

00:12:57.390 --> 00:13:00.710
So it's important to make sure...
that you don't end up malnourished!

00:13:07.630 --> 00:13:08.760
Well, whatever.

00:13:09.350 --> 00:13:10.800
Just kidding!

00:13:18.420 --> 00:13:19.440
I knew it.

00:13:21.460 --> 00:13:22.440
There's no doubt!

00:13:25.170 --> 00:13:26.180
Grea!

00:13:28.710 --> 00:13:31.450
Your tail has really filled out!

00:13:40.130 --> 00:13:41.760
It looks great!

00:13:45.130 --> 00:13:46.340
Grea?
